### Migly API request collection (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
# 1) Run "register", open Mailpit (http://localhost:8025), copy the token into @verifyToken, run "verify".
# 2) Run "login" and copy accessToken into @token (or use the seeded alice@migly.local account).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-access-token-here
@verifyToken = paste-token-from-email
@peerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@conversationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@messageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (checks the database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Register → 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"S3cure-pass-123","username":"alice","displayName":"Alice"}

### Verify email → 204 (400 unknown token, 410 used/expired)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{verifyToken}}"}

### Login → 200 {accessToken, expiresAt, user} + HttpOnly refresh cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"S3cure-pass-123"}

### Wrong password → 401 with a generic message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","password":"wrong-password"}

### Refresh (cookie + CSRF header) → 200 and a rotated cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

### Me → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Me without token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me

### Update display name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Alice from room 412"}

### Search users (prefix, min 2 chars) → {items,total,next}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?q=bo&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Personal chat with a user (404 = no chat yet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/direct/{{peerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### First personal message (creates the chat) → 201; same clientMessageId again → 200, no duplicate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/direct/{{peerId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientMessageId":"0192f0c4-7d4e-7a3b-9f10-3c2a1b0e9d11","body":"Hey, are you ready for class?"}

### Send to a conversation → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientMessageId":"0192f0c4-7d4e-7a3b-9f10-3c2a1b0e9d13","body":"On my way","replyToMessageId":null,"attachments":[{"fileName":"notes.pdf","sizeBytes":48213,"contentType":"application/pdf"}]}

### Empty message → 422 with errors.body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientMessageId":"0192f0c4-7d4e-7a3b-9f10-3c2a1b0e9d14","body":"   "}

### History: newest page, then older with before=<sequence>, resync with after=<sequence>
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?before=20&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?after=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit my message (≤ 48 h)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"On my way, 5 minutes"}

### Edit history (author only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delivery / read info (author only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (tombstone) → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark read up to a sequence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"upToSequence":42}

### Search messages → {items,total,next}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/messages?q=pizza&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a group (≥ 3 people including you) → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Room 412 · Study crew","memberIds":["{{peerId}}","00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"]}

### Group members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Make a member admin (owner only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/members/{{peerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"Admin"}

### Leave a group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Forgot password → 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com"}

### Admin: users (limit/offset + total) — 403 for non-admins
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
